## Estrutura de arquivos (`src/`)

```
components/     # Compartilhados — usar antes de criar local
  dashboard/    # KpiCard, SectionTitle, SortTableTh, SelectComIcone, FunilVisual, DashboardPageHeader, …
  PageHeader.tsx
  InfluencerMultiSelect.tsx
  OperacoesModal.tsx (ModalBase, ModalHeader)
  CampoObrigatorioMark.tsx
constants/      # theme.ts (FONT), menu.ts, platforms.ts
context/        # AppContext — theme, permissions, operadoraBrand
hooks/          # usePermission, useDashboardBrand, useDashboardFiltros, useMediaQuery
lib/            # tableStyles, dashboardHelpers, classificacaoSort, supabase, …
pages/          # Por secção — ver MDC da secção (geral, dashboards, lives, …)
.cursor/rules/  # global, brand, geral, escala, rh, <secao>.mdc
styles/         # global.css, responsive.css
types/          # PageKey, Role, PermissaoValor, …
```

Ao criar página nova: alinhar `types` (`PageKey`), `constants/menu.ts`, `App.tsx`, `GestaoUsuarios/constants.ts` (`PAGES`) — ver secção Permissões.

