## Classes CSS (`responsive.css`)

Usar via `className` — não recriar inline:

```
app-page-shell, app-page-shell--pb64
app-grid-kpi-3 … app-grid-kpi-6, app-grid-2, app-grid-2-tight, app-grid-3
app-table-wrap
app-conversao-vs-row, app-conversao-funil-duo
```

Nunca `@media` inline em componentes.

**Breakpoints** (`global.css`): `<480px` zoom 0.80 · `480–900px` 0.84 + drawer · `>900px` 0.90 + sidebar 240px.

